### 1. POST create (Crear producto)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Laptop ASUS ROG",
    "price": 20000.67,
    "stock": 10,
    "description": "Laptop gamer with RTX 5090",
    "brand": "ASUS",
    "img": "https://ejemplo.com/asus/HOLIS.jpg"
}






















