### 3. GET getById (Consulta por ID activo)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/getById/4


























### 4. PUT update (Actualización completa)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/update/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Laptop ASUS ROG Strix",
    "price": 29000.00,
    "stock": 3,
    "description": "MOD with 32GB RAM",
    "brand": "ASUS",
    "img": "https://ejemplo.com/asus-zephyrus.jpg"
}














### 5. PATCH change-price (Cambio de precio)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/change-price/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "price": 24500.00
}
















