### 9. POST create (Error 400 - Datos inválidos)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Screen broken",
    "price": -100,
    "stock": 5,
    "description": "The price is negative, it should fail"
}




















### 10. GET getById (Error 404 - ID inexistente)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/getById/9999